# buzz.scn: the buzzer and the LCD switch, shared by scenario_host and rt_test (pocketstation/tools/scenario.py).
# Author: suinevere
# Tones and LCD switches between frame ticks, with repeats and the lowest and highest tones; both sides log each call
# with the idles begun before it. No Sleep, whose blanking the harness would also log as an LCD switch.
enable 0x0100
tick 1
buzz 96
idle 2
buzz 192
lcd 0
idle 1
buzz 0
lcd 1
buzz 1
buzz 255
buzz 255
idle 1
buzz 0
buzz 0
lcd 0
